1
00:00:00,166 --> 00:00:01,418
The hell are you doing?

2
00:00:01,459 --> 00:00:02,459
Assemble!

3
00:00:02,919 --> 00:00:05,547
What the hell were you up to
while I was absent?

4
00:00:06,047 --> 00:00:07,047
Lee Jeongho!

5
00:00:07,173 --> 00:00:08,925
You are the captain
what were you doing?

6
00:00:08,925 --> 00:00:09,634
I'm sorry.

7
00:00:09,884 --> 00:00:10,884
Kim Taehun!

8
00:00:11,011 --> 00:00:13,013
Did you mean to pick fight
when you said results?

9
00:00:13,304 --> 00:00:15,640
Then go join the boxing club
and stop messing ours!

10
00:00:15,890 --> 00:00:16,558
I'm sorry.

11
00:00:16,808 --> 00:00:18,685
And the rest of you
were just watching?

12
00:00:19,060 --> 00:00:20,079
Is this what you call team?

13
00:00:20,103 --> 00:00:21,312
We are sorry!

14
00:00:23,773 --> 00:00:25,900
You asked for one last chance

15
00:00:26,401 --> 00:00:28,903
so I talk to the principal
about it.

16
00:00:30,196 --> 00:00:31,823
Fortunately, he agreed to it

17
00:00:32,240 --> 00:00:34,450
so we got the permission
to play at the tournament.

18
00:00:36,911 --> 00:00:37,911
But!

19
00:00:37,954 --> 00:00:40,623
If you don't get any result
in this tournament, it's over.

20
00:00:40,999 --> 00:00:42,792
So behave well, don't fight.

21
00:00:42,792 --> 00:00:43,376
Understood?

22
00:00:43,460 --> 00:00:44,460
Yes, sir!

23
00:00:44,586 --> 00:00:47,047
So we are holding a training
camp before the tournament.

24
00:00:47,380 --> 00:00:48,380
Training camp?

25
00:00:48,590 --> 00:00:50,008
We only have a month.

26
00:00:50,216 --> 00:00:51,926
So do your best
learn to work with others.

27
00:00:52,177 --> 00:00:53,887
Rooms will be shared
two per room.

28
00:00:54,095 --> 00:00:55,388
Divided by your position.

29
00:00:55,555 --> 00:00:56,555
Damn it.

30
00:00:57,724 --> 00:00:58,975
Please, don't match
him with me.

31
00:00:59,559 --> 00:01:00,643
Kim Taehun, Lee Jeongho!

32
00:01:01,019 --> 00:01:01,561
Room 101.

33
00:01:01,770 --> 00:01:02,770
What?
